{"id":"458fd0dccec3665f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-test-function.md","title":"Test Function","display":"df-test-function — Test Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-test-function","aliases":["58-df-test-function","Test Function"],"display":"df-test-function — Test Function","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-support.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-test-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-test-function</span><span>Test Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-test-function — Test Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edc520f758b19264\" href=\"?note=edc520f758b19264\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-support.md\">../batch01/58-df-support.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3482d3dfe87a8b71\" href=\"?note=3482d3dfe87a8b71\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> (参数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\\)</span> (Euclidean standard topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Open}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Open}_S\\)</span> (开集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (光滑实函数空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Support}_S\\)</span> (全参数支集关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"edc520f758b19264\" href=\"?note=edc520f758b19264\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-support.md\">../batch01/58-df-support.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S\\)</span> (子空间拓扑谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3482d3dfe87a8b71\" href=\"?note=3482d3dfe87a8b71\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (紧空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\)</span> (本文件定义的测试函数空间)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\\)</span>，取 <code>58-df-euclidean-topological-data</code> 的显式欧氏拓扑，不是可任意重选的拓扑参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}test\\text{-}function}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\n\\to\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\coloneqq C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\n=\\left\\{\\phi\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists\\tau_\\Omega,S,\\tau_S\\;\\bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}},\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Support}_S(S,\\phi,\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega,\\mathbb R,0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}},S,\\tau_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau_S)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}test\\text{-}function}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\n\\to\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\coloneqq C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\n=\\left\\{\\phi\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists\\tau_\\Omega,S,\\tau_S\\;\\bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}},\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Support}_S(S,\\phi,\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega,\\mathbb R,0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}},S,\\tau_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(S,\\tau_S)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Test function space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{D}(\\Omega) = C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal{D}(\\Omega) = C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\)</span>: foundation of distribution theory</li>\n<li>“紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>”已展开为：用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 的子空间拓扑计算支集，并要求该支集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 的子空间拓扑下紧；不再依赖未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}\\)</span> 函数或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Subset\">\\(\\Subset\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>测试函数拓扑与分布空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\\)</span> 是依赖此定义的后续原子，不再混入同一 assertion。</li>\n<li>Examples: Dirac <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>, principal value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/x\">\\(1/x\\)</span>, Heaviside step <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span></li>\n<li>Differentiation of distributions: always defined; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;[\\phi] = -T[\\phi&#39;]\">\\(T&#39;[\\phi] = -T[\\phi&#39;]\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Schwartz, Théorie des Distributions</li>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Hörmander, The Analysis of Linear Partial Differential Operators</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"edc520f758b19264","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-support.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3482d3dfe87a8b71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top5-subspace-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (开集谓词, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)$ (光滑实函数空间, see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"